#: ../../../prop_test/FIXTURE_REPEAT_MODE.rst:2
msgid "FIXTURE_REPEAT_MODE"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_test/FIXTURE_REPEAT_MODE.rst:6
msgid ""
"Specifies how a test fixture behaves when :manual:`ctest(1)` repeats tests "
"with its :ctest-option:`--repeat` option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_test/FIXTURE_REPEAT_MODE.rst:9
msgid ""
"The property describes the fixture rather than the test carrying it, so "
"setting it on any one of the fixture's setup or cleanup tests is enough.  It "
"has no effect on a test that has neither a :prop_test:`FIXTURES_SETUP` nor "
"a :prop_test:`FIXTURES_CLEANUP` property, although :manual:`ctest(1)` still "
"rejects a value it does not recognize."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_test/FIXTURE_REPEAT_MODE.rst:15
msgid "The value must be one of the following:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_test/FIXTURE_REPEAT_MODE.rst:17
msgid "``AROUND_ALL_REPEATS``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_test/FIXTURE_REPEAT_MODE.rst:18
msgid ""
"The fixture runs once, around all repetitions of the tests requiring it::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_test/FIXTURE_REPEAT_MODE.rst:20
msgid "setup -> test -> test -> test -> cleanup"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_test/FIXTURE_REPEAT_MODE.rst:22
msgid "``AROUND_EACH_REPEAT``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_test/FIXTURE_REPEAT_MODE.rst:23
msgid ""
"The fixture repeats with the tests requiring it, so that every repetition of "
"a test gets a fresh setup and its own cleanup::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_test/FIXTURE_REPEAT_MODE.rst:26
msgid "setup -> test -> cleanup -> setup -> test -> cleanup -> ..."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_test/FIXTURE_REPEAT_MODE.rst:28
msgid "``EACH_TEST_SEPARATELY``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_test/FIXTURE_REPEAT_MODE.rst:29
msgid ""
"No test is treated specially: every test, including the fixture's own setup "
"and cleanup tests, runs all of its repetitions before the next test starts::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_test/FIXTURE_REPEAT_MODE.rst:32
msgid "setup -> setup -> setup -> test -> test -> test -> cleanup -> ..."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_test/FIXTURE_REPEAT_MODE.rst:34
msgid "This is the behavior of CMake 4.4 and below."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_test/FIXTURE_REPEAT_MODE.rst:36
msgid ""
"If the property is not set on any of a fixture's setup or cleanup tests, the "
"behavior is determined by policy :policy:`CMP0224`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_test/FIXTURE_REPEAT_MODE.rst:39
msgid ""
"Fixtures that repeat together must agree on the mode.  All of a fixture's "
"own setup and cleanup tests must request the same mode, and so must any two "
"fixtures that share a test, since one test cannot repeat with one fixture "
"and not with another it takes part in.  :manual:`ctest(1)` reports an error "
"and runs nothing if they disagree."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_test/FIXTURE_REPEAT_MODE.rst:45
msgid ""
"In ``AROUND_EACH_REPEAT`` mode the fixture's tests repeat as a unit, so :"
"ctest-option:`--repeat` applies its condition to the unit as a whole. "
"``until-fail`` repeats while every test in the unit passes, ``until-pass`` "
"repeats while any of them does not pass, and ``after-timeout`` repeats while "
"any of them times out.  A test that requires two fixtures in "
"``AROUND_EACH_REPEAT`` mode makes those fixtures repeat together."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_test/FIXTURE_REPEAT_MODE.rst:52
msgid ""
"Only the last repetition of the unit is reported, as for a test repeating on "
"its own, and a test that lists one of the unit's tests in its :prop_test:"
"`DEPENDS` property runs after that last repetition.  If :manual:`ctest(1)` "
"is interrupted part-way through the repetitions, :ctest-option:`-F` resumes "
"by running the whole unit again."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_test/FIXTURE_REPEAT_MODE.rst:59
msgid "Example"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_test/FIXTURE_REPEAT_MODE.rst:61
msgid ""
"add_test(NAME start_server COMMAND start_server)\n"
"set_tests_properties(start_server PROPERTIES\n"
"  FIXTURES_SETUP Server\n"
"  FIXTURE_REPEAT_MODE AROUND_EACH_REPEAT)\n"
"\n"
"add_test(NAME query_server COMMAND query_server)\n"
"set_tests_properties(query_server PROPERTIES FIXTURES_REQUIRED Server)\n"
"\n"
"add_test(NAME stop_server COMMAND stop_server)\n"
"set_tests_properties(stop_server PROPERTIES FIXTURES_CLEANUP Server)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_test/FIXTURE_REPEAT_MODE.rst:74
msgid ""
"With ``ctest --repeat until-fail:3``, this runs a fresh server for each "
"attempt at ``query_server``::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_test/FIXTURE_REPEAT_MODE.rst:77
msgid ""
"start_server -> query_server -> stop_server\n"
"start_server -> query_server -> stop_server\n"
"start_server -> query_server -> stop_server"
msgstr ""

